*.qplugx binary
# The published .qplug must be the same bytes everyone else got. build.js emits it with CRLF
# terminators; without -text git stores an LF blob, so a clone on Linux or macOS produces a
# file that differs from the one in the release. Measured 2026-09-17: the blob came back
# 8ec116de against c608535d on disk.
*.qplug -text
